WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.127 --> 00:00:03.003
I’m Jane.

00:00:03.003 --> 00:00:05.755
Saving animals takes time,
and we need everyone to help.

00:00:05.755 --> 00:00:07.132
Nothing's impossible.

00:00:07.132 --> 00:00:08.133
Hold on tight!

00:00:08.133 --> 00:00:09.968
Anything’s possible.

00:00:09.968 --> 00:00:12.637
Close your eyes and imagine.

00:00:12.637 --> 00:00:14.264
Jane Goodall is one of my heroes.

00:00:14.264 --> 00:00:16.266
She's such an advocate for all animals.

00:00:16.266 --> 00:00:19.936
Every day you live, you make
 some impact on the planet.

00:00:20.020 --> 00:00:23.440
My mission is to create a 
world where we can live in 
harmony with nature.

00:00:23.606 --> 00:00:25.358
It's very important for children

00:00:25.358 --> 00:00:28.945
to know that they themselves
can make a difference.

00:00:29.154 --> 00:00:31.031
I wanted to write a positive song.

00:00:31.031 --> 00:00:32.949
Every one step, you’re one step closer.

00:00:32.949 --> 00:00:34.242
That nothing's impossible.

00:00:34.242 --> 00:00:35.243
I like lines like that.

00:00:35.243 --> 00:00:37.328
They make you feel like
you could do anything.

00:00:37.328 --> 00:00:38.496
There's an animal down there

00:00:38.496 --> 00:00:40.040
that needs our help!

00:00:40.040 --> 00:00:41.207
[Screaming]

00:00:41.207 --> 00:00:45.128
To be able to do this with Diane
was just so special to me.

00:00:45.503 --> 00:00:47.714
We're both real animal people.

00:00:47.714 --> 00:00:51.509
We love animals, so I'm so happy.

00:00:54.095 --> 00:00:58.558
With every one step, you get
closer to your dreams.

00:00:58.558 --> 00:01:03.396
It’s not as far as you think.

00:01:05.315 --> 00:01:06.483
That was awesome.

00:01:06.483 --> 00:01:10.862
This is exactly the kind of message
I want to put out there right now.

00:01:10.904 --> 00:01:11.780
The least I can do

00:01:11.780 --> 00:01:14.324
is speak out for those
who cannot speak for themselves.

00:01:14.365 --> 00:01:18.078
I hope that children will learn
from this show that every single

00:01:18.078 --> 00:01:21.331
one of them has a potential
to help save the world.

00:01:21.331 --> 00:01:25.585
With every one step, you
 get closer to your dreams.

00:01:25.585 --> 00:01:29.380
It’s not as far as you think.

00:01:30.340 --> 00:01:32.926
Living in harmony with 
nature isn't easy, is it?

00:01:34.511 --> 00:01:37.055
No, but it's worth it.

00:01:37.055 --> 00:01:41.476
You get where you need to go.

00:01:41.476 --> 00:01:43.394
Hey, hey!

